  - title: What is a Rime?
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 0
    informationBeats:
    - message: A rime is the ending part of a word.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5659231b2ff6029428a2d027419a7999, type: 3}
    - message: Words with the same rime usually have similar sounds.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ee8606ab06c5114b8f9e5b9bc5f190f, type: 3}
    - message: Today we will learn the rimes -am, -an, and -at.
