  - title: Ham
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The first word you're going to learn is the word ham.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac29f09b02a157848a3863a036c62f9c, type: 3}
    - message: Ham is a kind of meat that tastes salty and yummy to eat.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fbaa3f2d72f26449aa93595e7debcaa, type: 3}
    - message: The word Ham begins with the initial letter H.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5cd9eedb5d3b8bc46ad586730beb8883, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter a, m.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97cd42c6849d39e4d8dde5cb4980c811, type: 3}
    - message: Since H is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ced1b82ca3bc974eb09c9774d421ab7, type: 3}
    - message: The word Ham ends with the rime -am.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba3805adeb0d13545ad61107c0b42927, type: 3}
    practiceWord: ham
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Ham?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e87b49a86ba8e5740a09a5c47a26f7b0, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct!
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90e2580d00d86d440b914433db041fc3, type: 3}
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try Again.
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4f9a5ae60016d2488f2c66cadae99b1, type: 3}
